WEBVTT

00:04.500 --> 00:17.660
HAIEC gives you evidence-bound assurance for
consequential AI. Understand what your AI can do.
Assure what it does. Govern what it may do —
in any industry.

00:18.560 --> 00:33.520
A plant-floor AI was told to update work order
4802. It performed flawlessly — on work order
4803. HAIEC's deterministic engine caught the
divergence. Verdict: review required.

00:34.420 --> 00:48.260
Then the agent tried to write back to the factory
system. Its declared scope doesn't allow it —
so the action is held for a human, while a
permitted advisory note proceeds.

00:49.160 --> 01:01.390
This is a working digital factory: work orders,
purchase orders, live equipment telemetry —
one shared state that responds to every action
through the same operating boundary.

01:02.290 --> 01:19.030
Watch two decisions stay independent. The buyer
approves the spend — but the supplier's
qualification expired, so the commitment holds.
The qualified order approves, and commits.

01:19.930 --> 01:30.620
Anomalies become monitoring observations —
a torque spike, a lost signal — alongside the
human operating report and the exact record of
what was asked, decided, and simulated.

01:31.520 --> 01:40.630
Know what your AI can do. Govern what it may do.
Verify what happened. Every finding is
digest-verified — and this receipt is public.

01:45.000 --> 01:53.480
Deploy AI with confidence. Stay in control of
every consequential action. Explore the
interactive digital factory yourself.
